{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Deadswitch Combat",
    "steam_appid": 3408170,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/ae5bde5d7ae90822ff9995989a7630f7.avif?t=1754946841\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the official Discord server to start beta testing!</strong> Check the links to the right --&gt;</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/6699acde01bf4d58c32613427eadd88a.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/12a1e1fbd20caa43ff84fe6306b64735.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/3956cdb800de220adad48fa31692d215.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/43f82d52fa88313466e2eef66fa017f4.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/6699acde01bf4d58c32613427eadd88a.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/12a1e1fbd20caa43ff84fe6306b64735.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/3956cdb800de220adad48fa31692d215.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/43f82d52fa88313466e2eef66fa017f4.avif?t=1754946841\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BETA TESTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to start beta testing before launch! Check the links to the right --&gt;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters and loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom servers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Deadswitch Combat is a fast-paced 2D multiplayer shooter. Experience action-packed combat with hundreds of weapons, vehicle combat, and plenty of team-based game modes.",
